udents examine how targets influence effort, risk-taking, cooperation, and gaming."}, {"id": "f1ae5e84-b9bd-45d3-aeaf-1727e6fb1102", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Management Control Systems", "children": [{"id": "545485e4-b3be-4367-8f56-05a0b015a74c", "type": "concept", "title": "Results controls"}, {"id": "621732e4-1c52-4383-b143-5e78e99b8418", "type": "concept", "title": "Action controls"}, {"id": "f5aeaa14-5a83-4afa-a718-747eb969f8ed", "type": "concept", "title": "Personnel controls"}, {"id": "c711cbc8-4f68-475f-a9c9-66ea78d5352b", "type": "concept", "title": "Cultural controls"}, {"id": "be569f3f-45fe-41ed-98a6-16c6c5337fc6", "type": "concept", "title": "Internal control alignment"}], "description": "This subtopic connects accounting measures with governance, controls, and accountability."}, {"id": "41325d99-dd5b-40ee-a4d9-d761b39bdcff", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Analytics for Managerial Accounting", "children": [{"id": "cb5dceb5-843c-48d3-a5b5-4897b7a8553f", "type": "concept", "title": "Data cleaning"}, {"id": "1114ab41-b7b9-4ae9-8419-c832435763a3", "type": "concept", "title": "Variance drill-downs"}, {"id": "dd670408-0c46-4d5f-8dc0-8529769ee370", "type": "concept", "title": "Regression for cost estimation"}, {"id": "5f3832ef-25d8-401a-bd8f-2a115e8ac53a", "type": "concept", "title": "Rolling forecasts"}, {"id": "f2a67dbc-547a-4461-8202-06a191c7571b", "type": "concept", "title": "Visualization and dashboard tools"}], "description": "Students apply data tools to forecasts, variance investigation, and exception reporting."}]}, {"id": "7f5a3bb0-c1ec-4804-9e5e-a1cefbe16af2", "type": "topic", "title": "Sustainability Costing, Controller Advisory, and Integrative Case", "description": "Applies managerial accounting to ESG metrics, rolling forecasts, executive communication, and a final decision memo.", "children": [{"id": "09f5fcad-6b93-4444-bf17-c833e4ea4997", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Sustainability and ESG Costing", "children": [{"id": "ed72e269-4105-470b-a