-1bcd-4dfa-b7a8-3015271a3eb1", "type": "concept", "title": "Time-driven overhead"}], "description": "Students adapt job costing to consulting, legal work, construction, repair, health services, and client engagements."}]}, {"id": "a5798328-ea30-448e-acf4-1a2a6e2cef10", "type": "topic", "title": "Process Costing and Equivalent Units", "description": "Explains costing for continuous, homogeneous production environments.", "children": [{"id": "77da5e66-c413-4e7d-aae3-6d1f4b417c42", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Process Cost Flow", "children": [{"id": "b5ec9440-cf9a-42cb-bb27-2737c05bae61", "type": "concept", "title": "Processing departments"}, {"id": "9796196f-ec30-4f86-b643-0fb127ce916d", "type": "concept", "title": "Transferred-in costs"}, {"id": "6b5818ab-1fcb-4a4e-9cf3-996000c663d2", "type": "concept", "title": "Materials added at different points"}, {"id": "cb8ac234-7c92-4025-a0f2-39f790aead57", "type": "concept", "title": "Conversion costs"}, {"id": "be1c534d-dfad-45f2-8ec2-6fda7272e17b", "type": "concept", "title": "Cost reconciliation"}], "description": "This subtopic covers how costs accumulate by department or process in high-volume operations."}, {"id": "a6309b01-e430-4894-8503-5baa44e03585", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Equivalent Unit Calculations", "children": [{"id": "25b68c17-0bad-4ebb-ba50-4f3cdc11504e", "type": "concept", "title": "Physical units"}, {"id": "056e4662-6a27-4add-a1b3-89824f03847b", "type": "concept", "title": "Equivalent units"}, {"id": "6afc25dc-ce39-4530-bf18-aa597cb17af9", "type": "concept", "title": "Percentage of completion"}, {"id": "d00fec75-56c2-43fb-b675-7b570371d8d9", "type": "concept", "title": "Weighted-average method"}, {"id": "3dc6f4fb-cff3-4bd3-ac33-2d07311c26e4", "type": "concept", "title": "FIFO method"}], "description": "Students learn to translate partially completed units into comparable completed-unit measures."}, {"id": "fb9c5572-6da7-4e1d-9e62-4cf921937456", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Spoilage, Yield, and Production Losses", "children": [{"id": "27f22fde-6083-489f-bd3e-7c2ee7c5fbf7", "type": "concept", "title": "Normal spoilage"}, {"id": "18ef4260-6d61-4dd7-9f39-b09f35fe84ee", "type": "concept", "title": "Abnormal spoilage"}, {"id": "fd8db870-784c-4069-a8c6-55019a3b2b8a", "type": "concept", "title": "Yield loss"}, {"id": "ad6788b1-07ef-4ef9-9c8d-3a7ff2bc437a", "type": "concept", "title": "Rework"}, {"id": "e21be263-fa88-44cf-a411-193f325c1fbf", "type": "concept", "title": "Scrap accounting"}], "description": "Students learn how normal and abnormal losses affect product cost and operational interpretation."}]}, {"id": "2ad90719-1412-46de-96ae-1fd973f34d6a", "type": "topic", "title": "Activity-Based Costing and Activity-Based Management", "description": "Refines overhead assignment and turns activity data into process improvement decisions.", "children": [{"id": "588a3b21-9e5d-45e6-b14f-0a70ea0dd5ca", "type": "subtopic", "title": "ABC Design", "children": [{"id": "3b2ac972-83a1-4666-b177-0e7704a8d49b", "type": "concept", "title": "Activities"}, {"id": "a628935f-1341-4c64-9595-1122a8cba02e", "type": "concept", "title": "Cost pools"}, {"id": "a1309c33-cb72-47d6-a856-a770471fa7a8", "type": "concept", "title": "Cost drivers"}, {"id": "68f7e7ad-d7a7-4b92-9f53-1c24c0f232fc", "type": "concept", "title": "Transaction drivers"}, {"id": "f60ad87c-3753-4460-8281-f8710e0f9652", "type": "concept", "title": "Duration and intensity drivers"}], "description": "Students learn to assign overhead through activities that better explain resource consumption."}, {"id": "265c55d8-06a1-46de-88dd-df15e838516b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Product, Customer, and Channel Costing", "children": [{"id": "63549686-c022-4fd9-a3d3-2492323aedd6", "type": "concept", "title": "Batch-level costs"}, {"id": "30e42750-1ce0-4815-b88c-c33d033ec27c", "type": "concept", "title": "Product-sustaining costs"}, {"id": "c7414015-692a-4acc-9a18-39d69d7aadcf", "type": "concept", "title": "Customer-sustaining costs"}, {"id": "59253ad8-9644-4633-9844-a455ea62cbc8", "type": "concept", "title": "Order complexity"}, {"id": "60cf099a-8bff-4e34-bf92-af5c6c70abb5", "type": "concept", "title": "Channel support costs"}], "description": "ABC reveals how complexity and service demands affect profitability beyond simple volume measures."}, {"id": "c8eb851f-d7cd-4fcb-a28b-beecb1c50243", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Activity-Based Management", "children": [{"id": "4cdd1a4f-6494-419c-9428-9dcdaa136391", "type": "concept", "title": "Value-added activities"}, {"id": "538d112d-503c-467d-81dd-16c52e0f2c4e", "type": "concept", "title": "Non-value-added activities"}, {"id": "a48ecda6-db2d-4050-a6a8-bdfb14d4f4b9", "type": "concept", "title": "Process maps"}, {"id": "1d74e891-73e7-4dba-8cb6-5553fa05d2b7", "type": "concept", "title": "Capacity costs"}, {"id": "a078a12c-539a-4645-b1ad-aeb073cf3b97", "type": "concept", "title": "Time-driven ABC"}], "description": "Students use activity information to improve processes and eliminate waste."}]}, {"id": "4c53141e-d08c-41c4-9652-dfc0f753b22d", "type": "topic", "title": "Cost-Volume-Profit Analysis and Operating Leverage", "description": "Connects price, volume, mix, fixed costs, and profit risk.", "children": [{"id": "c81c225e-dd6f-4474-bba8-67dfa245675d", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Contribution Margin Structure", "children": [{"id": "3ea5ad7f-df79-4813-97ac-91319bec9632", "type": "concept", "title": "Contribution margin per unit"}, {"id": "056737bd-dce6-4480-a63f-b3baf6ff3c98", "type": "concept", "title": "Contribution margin ratio"}, {"id": "913aa7dc-da68-4664-a732-acae08222c8a", "type": "concept", "title": "Unit-level variable cost"}, {"id": "36017818-b914-494f-a548-0bc748bb057c", "type": "concept", "title": "Fixed cost coverage"}, {"id": "0cf7c5ac-0610-40cf-a8cb-2a9fdbb82bb6", "type": "concept", "title": "Income equation"}], "description": "This subtopic links sales, variable costs, and fixed costs to profit planning."}, {"id": "78507589-ecce-4bb4-b564-2b